  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). No pair verb. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{脱|ぬ}ぐ (take off X).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates resulting state. {脱|ぬ}いで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'has taken off' (is now without).\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{靴|くつ}→靴：00725_kutsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{脱|ぬ}ぐ (take off shoes)\n- ⟦{服|ふく}→服：00695_fuku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{脱|ぬ}ぐ (take off clothes)\n- ⟦{帽子|ぼうし}→帽子：00692_boushi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{脱|ぬ}ぐ (take off hat)\n- {脱|ぬ}いで⟦ください→下さい：02899_kudasai⟧ (please take off)\n\nUsed for all clothing types. Opposite verbs: ⟦{着|き}る→着る：00541_kiru⟧ (upper body), ⟦{履|は}く→履く：00700_haku⟧ (legs/feet), ⟦かぶる→かぶる：00709_kaburu⟧ (head).",
